{"sections":[{"slug":"单纯对象的分裂","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"单纯对象的分裂"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯对象的分裂</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"单纯对象的分裂"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $\\mathrm{surj}(j,k)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为单纯集</span> $\\Delta^j$ <span lang=\"zh\">到</span> $\\Delta^k$ <span lang=\"zh\">的满射的集合</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $K$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯对象</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">其</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">分裂</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">是一系列子对象</span> $N_k \\subset K_k\\,(k\\leq n)$, <span lang=\"zh\">称为非退化部分</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">满足对</span> $0\\leq j\\leq n$, <span lang=\"zh\">有典范的同构</span> $\\coprod_{\\mathrm{surj}(j,k)}N_k \\to K_j$. <span lang=\"zh\">直观上</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这个条件是说</span> $K$ <span lang=\"zh\">的每个可能退化的单形都唯一地对应一个非退化单形</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">集合范畴中的单纯对象</span> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯集","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯集</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">有唯一的分裂</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">单纯对象若存在分裂</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则分裂唯一</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">参考资料</span></h2>\n<p>Artin, Mazur, Etale Homotopy Theory</p>\n"}]}}}]}